  "共融，是讓不同能力和背景的人聚在一起，認識彼此的共通與差異，打破社會定型觀念，互相接納、尊重，並共享權利與義務。弱勢社群和社會大眾都能從共融體驗中受益。": "Inclusion means bringing people of different abilities and backgrounds together to understand each other's similarities and differences, break social stereotypes, accept and respect each other, and share rights and obligations. Disadvantaged communities and society at large can benefit from inclusive experiences.",
  "共融需要實踐，也需要每個人的參與和支持，才能建立更關愛的社會。": "Inclusion requires practice and everyone's participation and support to build a more caring society.",
  "香港約有 107 萬名 19 歲以下兒童": "There are approximately 1.07 million children under the age of 19 in Hong Kong",
  "萬名兒童": "10,000 children",
