  "另約 5 萬名 15 歲以下為少數族裔兒童": "Another 50,000 children under the age of 15 are from ethnic minorities",
  "約四分之一兒童屬弱勢群組。在生存、醫療和教育方面，香港已有較高水平，但弱勢兒童免受歧視、社交發展、社會參與及康樂遊樂的權利，仍未受到足夠重視。": "About a quarter of children belong to disadvantaged groups. Hong Kong has reached a relatively high level in terms of survival, medical care and education, but the rights of disadvantaged children to freedom from discrimination, social development, social participation and recreation have not received enough attention.",
  "香港於 1994 年成為聯合國《兒童權利公約》締約國，但並非每位兒童的成長與發展都獲得同等重視。": "Hong Kong became a party to the United Nations Convention on the Rights of the Child in 1994, but not every child's growth and development receive equal attention.",
  "香港缺乏兒童社會共融及社會排斥的指標，也缺乏反映殘疾兒童現況的準確數據，使相關政策難以真正回應弱勢兒童的需要。": "Hong Kong lacks indicators of children's social inclusion and social exclusion, as well as accurate data reflecting the current situation of children with disabilities, making it difficult for relevant policies to truly respond to the needs of disadvantaged children.",
  "「平等參與」、「開懷接納」和「學習欣賞」——所有收費自 2023 年 6 月 1 日起生效。網上報名表格適用於學校及團體，個別家長請致電 2889 1332。": "\"Equal Participation\", \"Open Acceptance\" and \"Learning to Appreciate\" - all charges are effective from June 1, 2023. The online registration form is applicable to schools and groups. Individual parents please call 2889 1332.",
