  "與小學版本相似\n收費 $2,200": "Similar to the primary school version\nCharge $2,200",
  "家長坊以共融教育為核心，相信家長是子女的第一位及最重要的老師。活動透過短講、角色扮演、討論和體驗遊戲，讓家長反思過往的育兒經驗，學習以身作則，培育善於溝通、勇於創新，並懂得接納、尊重及關愛他人的孩子。": "Parent Forum takes inclusive education as its core and believes that parents are their children’s first and most important teachers. Through short lectures, role plays, discussions and experiential games, the activity allows parents to reflect on past parenting experiences, learn to lead by example, and cultivate children who are good at communication, innovative, and know how to accept, respect and care for others.",
