  "以體驗活動、討論和小班互動為主：無歧視與偏見、平等參與、權利與我及技巧訓練等系列\n每節 $800\n部分單元需於禮堂或大型活動室進行": "Focusing on experiential activities, discussions and small class interactions: non-discrimination and prejudice, equal participation, rights and me, skills training and other series\n$800 per session\nSome units need to be conducted in the auditorium or large activity room",
