  "參加者創造自己的英雄角色，與隊友組成英雄團隊，一同展開冒險旅程，發揮合作與溝通能力，從多角度思考，合力化解危機。": "Participants create their own hero characters, form a hero team with their teammates, and embark on an adventure journey together. They use their cooperation and communication skills to think from multiple perspectives and work together to resolve crises.",
