  "親切與專業遊戲設計公司合作，首次籌劃及推出此桌上遊戲。遊戲結合角色扮演、策略、冒險及解難元素，以互動和創意的方式，讓參加者體驗共融學習。": "TREATS cooperated with a professional game design company to plan and launch this table game for the first time. The game combines role-playing, strategy, adventure and problem-solving elements to allow participants to experience inclusive learning in an interactive and creative way.",
  "學校及學生回饋": "School and student feedback",
  "遊戲的設計及形式「非常創新」，參加者能從中學會與人溝通和合作。": "The design and format of the game are \"very innovative\" and participants can learn to communicate and cooperate with others.",
  "官立嘉道理爵士小學老師": "Teacher at Sir Kadoorie Primary School, Government",
  "在遊戲中學會聆聽他人意見，團隊溝通十分重要。": "Learn to listen to other people's opinions in the game, and team communication is very important.",
  "獻主會溥仁小學同學": "Students from Puren Primary School of the Oblate Association",
  "親身接觸、愈早接觸和生活化的接觸，讓我們的下一代打破因彼此差異而造成的偏見。": "Personal contact, early contact and daily life contact allow our next generation to break the prejudice caused by our differences.",
  "學生每位 $100（全日）；$50（半日）（由 2023 年 6 月 1 日起生效）。特殊學校參加者豁免收費": "$100 per student (full day); $50 (half day) (effective from June 1, 2023). Fee exemption for special school participants",
  "以小組進行，讓參加者在平等平台上認識不同能力及背景的朋友，學習團隊合作、人際相處和溝通。營前，親切會到參與學校舉行準備活動，了解參加者情況以作配對和活動設計。": "Conducted in small groups, participants can get to know friends of different abilities and backgrounds on an equal platform and learn teamwork, interpersonal relationships and communication. Before the camp, TREATS will go to participating schools to hold preparatory activities to understand the participants’ situation for matching and activity design.",
