  "不同能力、背景及文化的參加者結伴走進社區，增進相互認識與接納。": "Participants with different abilities, backgrounds and cultures go into the community together to enhance mutual understanding and acceptance.",
  "天星銀行": "Skystar Bank",
  "親切為商界伙伴提供義工訓練，協助他們了解不同能力及背景兒童的特點與需要，並學習如何與他們溝通及相處。": "TREATS provides volunteer training to business partners to help them understand the characteristics and needs of children with different abilities and backgrounds, and learn how to communicate and get along with them.",
