  "您的捐款協助兒童擺脫排斥，在關愛、共融的社會中成長。約兩成經費來自香港公益金及香港賽馬會慈善信託基金，其餘來自個人及企業捐款；每年超過八成善款用於直接服務。": "Your donation helps children escape exclusion and grow up in a caring and inclusive society. About 20% of the funding comes from the Hong Kong Community Chest and the Hong Kong Jockey Club Charities Trust, and the rest comes from individual and corporate donations; more than 80% of the donations are used for direct services every year.",
