  "掃描二維碼，進入親切的頁面，可選擇單次或每月捐款，並可在程序中選擇是否需要正式收據。": "Scan the QR code to enter the TREATS page, where you can choose a single or monthly donation, and choose whether to require an official receipt in the program.",
  "如需正式收據，請截圖成功轉帳頁面，並連同中英文姓名、聯絡電話及電郵地址電郵至本會。": "If you need an official receipt, please take a screenshot of the successful transfer page and email it to our association along with your Chinese and English name, contact number and email address.",
