  "使用 PayMe 掃描原網站頁面上的 PayCode 即可捐款。": "Use PayMe to scan the PayCode on the original website page to donate.",
  "請在店方發出的收據上寫明中英文姓名、聯絡電話及電郵或郵寄地址，然後電郵或郵寄給本會。": "Please write your Chinese and English name, contact number and email or mailing address on the receipt issued by the store, and then email or mail it to our association.",
