  "現時中四的文匡在幼稚園時確診自閉症（ASD）和專注力失調及過度活躍症（ADHD）。不擅長運動的他機緣巧合下於2年前開始參加由慈善團體舉辦的「親切": "Wen Kuang, who is currently in Form 4, was diagnosed with autism spectrum disorder (ASD) and attention deficit hyperactivity disorder (ADHD) in kindergarten. Not good at sports, he started participating in \"TREATS\" organized by a charity organization 2 years ago by chance.",
